        {
          "text": "Kamboni wangu ngu-Leza, nguwenya ngwemanina milimo amuuya wangu mu-Makani Mabotu aa-Mwanaakwe, kuti ndamwiibaluka lyoonse cakutaleka munkombyo zyangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
