        },
        {
          "text": "Ikuti nsiyandi kuti mutazibi, nubakwesu, mbundakali kuyanda kanjikanji kuza kulindinywe (pele kusikila sunu ndakasigwa), kuti nkajane micelo imwi akati kandinywe anywebo, mbubonya mbuli mumasi amwi.",
          "type": "text",
