        {
          "text": "Nkaambo nsiusi insoni ku-Makani Mabotu aa-Kristo pe, nkaambo ninguzu zya-Leza zyakufutula boonse basyoma, kukusaanguna ba-Juda, elyo ba-Helene abalo. ",
