        {
          "text": "Ikuti bakalimuzi Leza, nekubaboobo teebakamulemeka nikuba kumulumba mbuli Leza, pele bakali kuyeeya miyeeyo yabuyo, nkabela myoyo yabo iitamvwi yakasizigwa. ",
